"language": "por",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p><data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108562\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Amós</data> transmitiu <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108534\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">mensagens de julgamento</data> sobre as nações ao redor do <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108479\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">reino do norte</data>. As mensagens foram registradas como <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108204\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">poemas</data>. Elas eram sobre os <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108434\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Arameus</data> de <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108540\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Damasco</data>, os <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108267\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Filisteus</data> e o povo de <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108475\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Tiro</data>. Elas eram sobre os <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108411\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Edomitas</data>, <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108412\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Amonitas</data>, <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108397\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Moabitas</data> e o povo do <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108480\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">reino do sul</data>. As terras desses grupos de pessoas estavam localizadas em um círculo. O reino do norte estava no centro desse círculo. Amós então falou sobre <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108199\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">Deus</data> trazendo <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"108233\" data-resource-code=\"BiblicaStudyNotesKeyTerms\">julgamento</data> contra o reino do norte também.</p>",
